From: Codex <codex@local>
Subject: radv: trace every Orbis queue submit from startup

Trace every queue submission entry and return for the diagnostic package. The
Titan Quest render stall is not at a stable submit count, so do not gate the
trace on an arbitrary sequence window. This makes the last entered submit and
its return status visible at whichever point the run stops.

---
diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_queue.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_queue.c
index f5c60d2..4f9eaa1 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_queue.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_queue.c
@@ -2590,2 +2590,1 @@ radv_queue_submit(struct vk_queue *vqueue, struct vk_queue_submit *submission)
-   const bool orbis_trace_submit = orbis_submit_trace_n <= 16 ||
-      (orbis_submit_trace_n >= 3001 && orbis_submit_trace_n <= 4096) || !(orbis_submit_trace_n % 120);
+   const bool orbis_trace_submit = true;
